 Chinese reach is richer!
  Incidentally, I ported the Chinese Wikipedia article on Lojban onto lojban.org (http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-index.php?page=Luojiyu) in order to evade the Great Firewall (which blocks Wikipedia but not lojban.org) and ensure that there is at least something about Lojban available in Chinese to people in mainland China. It would be great to develop more Chinese-language materials, something which I have a (vague, indefinite long-term) interest in.

